## Development

Requires rustup (the toolchain comes from `rust-toolchain.toml`) and make.

| Command | What it does |
|---|---|
| `make build` | Release binary in `target/release/` |
| `make test` | Unit and integration tests |
| `make lint` | rustfmt check and clippy with warnings denied |
| `make audit` | cargo-deny: advisories, licenses, sources |
| `make ci` | Everything CI runs |

See [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md) for how the code is laid out.

